pan class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(6px);transform:translateY(24px)">Little</span><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(6px);transform:translateY(24px)">Love</span><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(6px);transform:translateY(24px)">Story</span></h2><div class="gold-rule w-24 mx-auto mt-5 origin-center" style="opacity:0;transform:scaleX(0)"></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute left-5 sm:left-1/2 top-2 bottom-2 w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-gold to-transparent" style="transform-origin:top;transform:scaleY(0)"></div><div class="space-y-10 sm:space-y-16"><div class="relative grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-12 items-start " style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="relative flex justify-start sm:absolute sm:left-1/2 sm:-translate-x-1/2 sm:top-3 z-10"><span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-gold/40"></span><span class="relative flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-background border border-gold shadow-[0_0_0_4px_oklch(0.97_0.018_80)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-4 h-4 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg></span></div><div class="hidden sm:flex items-center justify-end pr-8"><span class="font-display italic text-6xl text-gold/80" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)">2019</span></div><div class="relative sm:pl-8" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)"><di