:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">A long quiet evening, two cups of coffee, and a question that changed everything.</p></div></div></div><div class="relative grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-12 items-start " style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="relative flex justify-start sm:absolute sm:left-1/2 sm:-translate-x-1/2 sm:top-3 z-10"><span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-gold/40"></span><span class="relative flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-background border border-gold shadow-[0_0_0_4px_oklch(0.97_0.018_80)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-gem w-4 h-4 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.5 3 8 9l4 13 4-13-2.5-6"></path><path d="M17 3a2 2 0 0 1 1.6.8l3 4a2 2 0 0 1 .013 2.382l-7.99 10.986a2 2 0 0 1-3.247 0l-7.99-10.986A2 2 0 0 1 2.4 7.8l2.998-3.997A2 2 0 0 1 7 3z"></path><path d="M2 9h20"></path></svg></span></div><div class="hidden sm:flex items-center justify-end pr-8"><span class="font-display italic text-6xl text-gold/80" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)">2024</span></div><div class="relative sm:pl-8" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)"><div class="ornament-frame px-5 py-5 sm:px-6 sm:py-6 rounded-sm"><span class="sm:hidden font-display italic text-2xl text-gold block mb-1">2024</span><h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-primary italic leading-tight">She Said Yes</h3><div class="gold-rule w-12 my-3 "></div><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">On a hill above the sea, with only the wind as witness.</p></div></div></div><div class="relative grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-12 items-start sm:[&amp;&gt;*:nth-child(2)]:order-1 sm:[&amp;&gt;*:nth-child(3)]:order-2" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="relative flex justify-start sm:absolute sm:left-1/2 sm:-translate-x-1/2 sm:top-3 z-10"><span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-gold/40"></span><span class="relative flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-background border border-gold shadow-[0_0_0_4px_oklch(0.97_0.018_80)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-infinity w-4 h-4 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 16c5 0 7-8 12-8a4 4 0 0 1 0 8c-5 0-7-8-12-8a4 4 0 1 0 0 8"></path></svg></span></div><div class="hidden sm:flex items-center justify-start pl-8"><span class="font-display italic text-6xl text-gold/80" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(30px)">2026</span></div><div class="relative sm:pr-8 sm:text-right" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-20px)"><div class="ornament-frame px-5 py-5 sm:px-6 sm:py-6 rounded-sm"><span class="sm:hidden font-display italic text-2xl text-gold block mb-1">2026</span><h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-primary italic leading-tight">Forever Begins</h3><div class="gold-rule w-12 my-3 sm:ml-auto"></div><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">And now we invite you to share the very first day of always with us.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="date" class="relative py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 overflow-hidden"><div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-12 sm:mb-16"><p class="section-eyebrow mb-4" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)">Tap to Reveal</p><h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl text-primary italic flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-3"><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(6px);transform:translateY(24px)">Save</span><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(6px);transform:translateY(24px)">The</span><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;filt