section-eyebrow mb-4" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)">The Celebration</p><h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl text-primary italic flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-3"><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(6px);transform:translateY(24px)">Wedding</span><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(6px);transform:translateY(24px)">Events</span></h2><div class="gold-rule w-24 mx-auto mt-5 origin-center" style="opacity:0;transform:scaleX(0)"></div><p class="mt-5 max-w-xl mx-auto text-muted-foreground text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)">It would be a great honour to share these moments with you.</p></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="ornament-frame p-8 sm:p-10 text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><p class="section-eyebrow">Event <!-- -->01</p><h3 class="mt-3 font-display italic text-4xl text-primary">Akad Nikah</h3><div class="gold-rule w-16 mx-auto my-5"></div><ul class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base"><li class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-foreground/80"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar w-4 h-4 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18"></path></svg>Saturday, 12 September 2026</li><li class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-foreground/80"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock w-4 h-4 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>09.00 — 11.00 WIB</li><li class="flex flex-col items-cente